---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const headshotUrl = "/eric%202026%20headshot.png";
---

<Base title="About - Eric Martin">
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="page-container-narrow">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
        <img
          src={headshotUrl}
          alt="Eric Martin"
          width="400"
          height="500"
          class="mx-auto aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[200px] shrink-0 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-panel object-cover shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(15,23,42,0.1)] sm:mx-0 sm:max-w-[220px]"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Revenue operations / technical systems / execution infrastructure</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">About</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted">
            I am a systems builder who understands operations and how to generate
            sustainable growth. My work sits where business development, field and
            service operations, and software architecture meet — usually in
            environments where the problem is already visible, but the operating
            system around it still needs to be built.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
            That has meant closing new work while standing up CRM and pipeline
            systems, scaling national field delivery, and building production
            platforms with approval-gated automation, operating visibility, and
            real rollout discipline.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
            Outside of work, I have been with my fiancee for over five years, and we
            have a two-year-old son, two dogs, a cat, and a ferret. I spend my time
            making and playing music, running, and being with my family.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="surface p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How I work</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
            <li>Start from how work actually moves, not from buzzwords or tool categories</li>
            <li>Make ownership, handoffs, and review points explicit</li>
            <li>Build for operators and leaders, not just demos or presentations</li>
            <li>Stay close through rollout, adoption, and the messy middle</li>
            <li>Tie technical decisions back to growth, delivery, and visibility outcomes</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="surface p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">What I value</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
            <li>Clarity over complexity</li>
            <li>Execution over theater</li>
            <li>Repeatable systems over one-off heroics</li>
            <li>Ownership over handoffs</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="surface-muted mt-8 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Where I fit</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
          Operator-led teams that need someone who can understand commercial motion,
          field reality, and software architecture at the same time. I fit best where
          growth bottlenecks are known, but the systems to make execution repeatable
          still need to be designed and shipped.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
